{{!
    @template format_dari/course_page
    @copyright  2026 Dari Learning
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    The course page body below the banner: the section description on a section page, then the
    section cards, the activity cards or core's course content.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * containerstyle string Custom properties for the container (card title size and course
      accent), validated in format_dari::get_accent_style(); empty for none.
    * hassummary bool True on a section page whose section has a visible description.
    * summary string The description, already through format_text(); triple mustache.
    * content string The rendered course content; triple mustache.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "containerstyle": "--dari-card-title-size:14px;",
        "hassummary": true,
        "summary": "<p>What this section covers.</p>",
        "content": "<ul class=\"dari-section-cards\"></ul>"
    }
}}
<div class="format-dari-container"{{#containerstyle}} style="{{containerstyle}}"{{/containerstyle}}>
    {{#hassummary}}
    <div class="format-dari-section-summary">{{{summary}}}</div>
    {{/hassummary}}
    <div class="course-content">{{{content}}}</div>
</div>
